# Technology Stack

## Core Technologies

- PostgreSQL 18 (Docker)
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- NestJS backend & CLI
- Zapatos for type-safe database operations
- Yarn package manager
- vitest for tests

## Database Connection

- Host: localhost:5532
- Database: pricecomp_db
- User: pricecomp_user
- Password: abc (dev only)

## Essential Commands

```bash
# Database
docker-compose up -d

# Build (standardized across subfolders)
yarn build

# Testing (standardized across subfolders)
yarn test
```

## Code Standards

- Use Zapatos for type-safe database operations
- Structured logging with context
- Prettier & lint pre-commit hooks
